gcm: stop reading the environment per FIFO packet (open upstream PR, imported as is).

The walker called getenv several times per drain pass; it runs on Resistance 3's present thread, and getenv takes the environment lock the other threads use.

Measured in Resistance 3 as one batch (#437 #438 #440 #458 #459 #465 #466), Home level, stick turning, two runs each:
22.7 -> 24.2 fps; present thread busy 640 -> 556 of 657 `sample` ticks. Frames of a scripted run unchanged.

Upstream: PR #437 (drop this file when the pin contains it).

---

